,"fs":40,"fw":"Bold","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","fd":1,"lh":1.1,"ls":-1,"mw":720,"nm":"H2"},{"k":"text","t":"The business keeps its name, its customers, and its own team. What Fullsteam adds is reach — people who already know the industry, and campaigns written for one niche audience instead of a general one.","fs":16,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","mw":680,"nm":"P"},{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"ph","mh":180,"nm":"Image placeholder"},{"k":"text","t":"Sales A go-to-market team that knows the buyers, the season, and how this industry buys. [placeholder]","fs":15,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","nm":"figcaption"}],"bg":"#FFFFFF","bd":{"c":"#000000","w":1,"dash":0,"s":"all"},"nm":"Card"},{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"ph","mh":180,"nm":"Image placeholder"},{"k":"text","t":"Marketing Content and campaigns written for one niche: real customer stories and concrete local examples. [placeholder]","fs":15,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","nm":"figcaption"}],"bg":"#FFFFFF","bd":{"c":"#000000","w":1,"dash":0,"s":"all"},"nm":"Card"},{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"ph","mh":180,"nm":"Image placeholder"},{"k":"text","t":"Cross-sell Payments, lending, and insurance go to customers the software already serves. [placeholder]","fs":15,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","nm":"figcaption"}],"bg":"#FFFFFF","bd":{"c":"#000000","w":1,"dash":0,"s":"all"},"nm":"Card"}],"d":"row","g":16,"nm":"Row"}],"g":16,"nm":"Cards"},{"k":"anno","t":"An overview, not a service menu. Nothing here may be read as a claim about growth rate, revenue, or profitability of a business we own.","lc":"#000000"}],"p":[0,24,0,24],"nm":"Wrap","w":"fixed","fw":1120}],"p":[64,0,64,0],"bg":"#FFFFFF","bd":{"c":"#000000","w":1,"dash":0,"s":"bottom"},"nm":"Section: block"},{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"text","t":"Operational advantages","fs":11,"fw":"Bold","ff":"mono","lc":"#000000","up":1,"ls":1.4,"nm":"Beat"},{"k":"text","t":"Talent","fs":40,"fw":"Bold","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","fd":1,"lh":1.1,"ls":-1,"mw":720,"nm":"H2"},{"k":"text","t":"The team that built the software stays, and gains a much larger company behind it. Hiring, back office, and career paths come from Fullsteam; the vertical keeps its own identity.","fs":16,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","mw":680,"nm":"P"},{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"ph","mh":180,"nm":"Image placeholder"},{"k":"text","t":"Hiring When the team needs to grow, it hires from a much larger pipeline. [placeholder]","fs":15,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","nm":"figcaption"}],"bg":"#FFFFFF","bd":{"c":"#000000","w":1,"dash":0,"s":"all"},"nm":"Card"},{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"ph","mh":180,"nm":"Image placeholder"},{"k":"text","t":"Mobility People can move between the software businesses Fullsteam owns without leaving the company. [placeholder]","fs":15,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","nm":"figcaption"}],"bg":"#FFFFFF","bd":{"c":"#000000","w":1,"dash":0,"s":"all"},"nm":"Card"},{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"ph","mh":180,"nm":"Image placeholder"},{"k":"text","t":"Support Finance, legal, HR, and compliance handled at group level, so the business can stay focused on its vertical. [placeholder]","fs":15,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","nm":"figcaption"}],"bg":"#FFFFFF","bd":{"c":"#000000","w":1,"dash":0,"s":"all"},"nm":"Card"}],"d":"row","g":16,"nm":"Row"}],"g":16,"nm":"Cards"},{"k":"text","t":"See open roles","fs":16,"fw":"Regular","ff":"sans","lc":"#000000","mw":680,"nm":"P"},{"k":"anno","t":"Never frame the story as headcount reduction, and never imply the acquired team is being absorbed or cut.","lc":"#000000"}],"p":[0,24,0,24],"nm":"Wrap","w":"fixed","fw":1120}],"p":[64,0,64,0],"bg":"#F3E6D0","bd":{"c":"#000000","w":1,"dash":0,"s":"bottom"},"nm":"Section: block tan"},{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"frame","c":[{"k":"text","t":"FAQ","fs":11,"fw":"Bold","ff":"mono","lc":"#000000","up":1,"ls":1.4,"nm":"Beat"},{"k":"text","t":"Intent: answer comm